{"step_index":261,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-10-13T13:15:24Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-13T18:45:24+05:30\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 5887f703-d3a8-4a6f-821e-7334da4dc75b/task-261\nTask Description: npm run build\nTask logs are available at: file:///C:/Users/PRIYANKA/.gemini/antigravity/brain/5887f703-d3a8-4a6f-821e-7334da4dc75b/.system_generated/tasks/task-261.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
{"step_index":262,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T13:17:29Z","thinking":"Reviewing the documentation requirements, it is apparent that a comprehensive `README.md` file needs creation. The necessary sections, as outlined, cover various aspects including the project's overview, features, technology stack, and architectural details. Additional sections will detail module boundaries, database schema, authentication, AI integration, resume generation, template rendering, and payment processes.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"# CareerOS: AI-Powered Career and Consultation Platform\n\nAn enterprise-grade, full-stack career platform featuring an **interactive ChatGPT-style AI career assistant**, a **structured multi-template AI resume builder with Tiptap editor**, and **verified 1-on-1 expert consultation bookings with Stripe payment integration, Google Calendar synchronization, and automated email confirmations**.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Project Overview\n\nCareerOS bridges advanced generative AI capabilities with real-world professional coaching workflows:\n1. **Secure Multi-Role Authentication**: JWT stored in HTTP-Only cookies with Argon2/bcrypt password hashing and role-based access control (`USER`, `ADMIN`, `CONSULTANT`).\n2. **AI Career Assistant**: ChatGPT-style persistent coaching conversations supporting the STAR behavioral method, system design prep, and offer negotiation.\n3. **Structured AI Resume Builder**: Lossless structured resume authoring with Tiptap rich-text formatting and live switching between **Modern Professional** and **ATS Classic** templates.\n4. **ATS Machine-Readable Output**: Semantic HTML hierarchy for high parseability, keyword extraction, and instant export/PDF printing.\n5. **Concurrency-Guarded Consultation Engine**: Prevents double-bookings and past bookings with compound database constraints.\n6. **Stripe Payments with Webhook Idempotency**: Server-side pricing enforcement, cryptographic HMAC signature validation, and event ledger idempotency.\n7. **Calendar & Email Orchestration**: Automated Google Meet link creation and Nodemailer email delivery, designed with graceful failure isolation (payment success is preserved even if third-party APIs encounter outages).\n8. **Real-time Analytics Dashboard**: Server-side MongoDB aggregation pipeline returning user-scoped resume metrics, active chat sessions, and upcoming consultations.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Technology Stack\n\n### Frontend\n- **Framework**: Next.js 14+ (App Router, Server & Client Components)\n- **Language**: TypeScript (Strict mode)\n- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS\n- **Rich Text Editor**: Tiptap (`@tiptap/react`, `@tiptap/starter-kit`)\n- **Forms & Validation**: React Hook Form with Zod schemas\n- **Icons**: Lucide React\n\n### Backend\n- **Runtime**: Node.js v20+ / v22+\n- **Server Framework**: Express.js with TypeScript\n- **Database ODM**: Mongoose with MongoDB\n- **Security**: Helmet, CORS with credentials, cookie-parser, bcryptjs\n- **Validation**: Zod (request body, query, and params validation)\n- **Logging**: Structured logger with severity levels (`info`, `warn`, `error`, `debug`)\n- **API Documentation**: OpenAPI / Swagger UI (`/api/docs`)\n\n### Testing\n- **Test Runner**: Jest (`ts-jest`)\n- **API Testing**: Supertest\n- **Database Test Isolation**: In-memory MongoDB (`mongodb-memory-server`)\n\n---\n\n## 3. Architecture & System Flow\n\n```\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                              Next.js 14+ Frontend (App Router)                    |\n|  - Tailwind CSS + UI Design System                                                |\n|  - Tiptap Rich Text Editor                                                        |\n|  - Real-time Client State & React Hook Form + Zod Validation                      |\n+-----------------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+\n                                          |\n                                    REST / JSON\n                                    HTTP-Only Cookies / Bearer Token\n                                          v\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                              Express.js Backend API Layer                         |\n|  - Centralized Error Handling Middleware                                          |\n|  - Role-Based Access Control (RBAC: USER, ADMIN, CONSULTANT)                      |\n|  - Strict Zod Request Validation                                                  |\n|  - Swagger / OpenAPI Auto-Documentation                                           |\n+-----+--------------+---------------+--------------+---------------+---------------+\n      |              |               |              |               |               |\n      v              v               v              v               v               v\n  [Auth & User]   [AI Chat]     [Resume & AI]  [Consultant]    [Booking]      [Payments]\n  - Argon2/bcrypt - Persistent   - Structured   - Profiles     - Concurrency   - Stripe Session\n  - Profile Mgmt  - Context LLM  - Tiptap Sync  - Availability - State Machine - Webhook Idemp.\n      |              |               |              |               |               |\n      +--------------+---------------+--------------+---------------+---------------+\n                                          |\n                                          v\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                  MongoDB Database                                 |\n|  - Indexed Schemas (Users, Resumes, ChatSessions, Bookings, Payments, etc.)       |\n|  - Atomicity, Unique Compound Constraints & Isolated Multi-Tenant Scopes          |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n          